 "purpose": "Audit of every input the A9.32 HallThruster.jl parametric feasibility envelope for H-1 needs, BEFORE the preregistration: what is registered, where, with what status and evidence class, and what is missing. No Hall run exists for any H-1 case; nothing here is a Hall result.",
 "method": "read-only inspection of the cited records at the base commit; every value is copied from the cited pointer (file sha256 recorded). Assembled by the lane; no value is computed except the B(z) file statistics (max, argmax, extent) of the two sourced P5 profiles.",
 "headline_findings": [
  "H1 B(z) is NOT registered: H1F-BZ-01 = TBD_AFTER_EVIDENCE (no FEMM of MC-1, no measured H-1 map). Registered for H-1: a qualitative shape target (H1F-BZ-02, OPEN, inferred: monotonic rise, peak at or just downstream of z = L, low field at the anode), a peak centreline B_r band 69.93-268.6 G (H1F-BZ-03, OPEN, model-derived, owner-accepted FEMM target band A9.14 F5-OQ-05, NOT a transport optimum) and a capability of 403 G (H1F-BZ-04, OPEN). The only sourced numeric B(z) shapes in the repository are the two P5 Peterson 2001 profiles, registered REFERENCE_FOR_P5_ONLY (bz_reference rule: no P5 value is transferred to H-1 as a design value).",
  "No H-1 design point is selected: H1F-CH-11 = TBD_AFTER_EVIDENCE. The registered geometry is the H1 freeze-candidate window (h, d_mean, L; OPEN) with 7 owner-authorised FEMM analysis points (A9.14 F5-OQ-01, ANALYSIS_POINTS_NOT_SELECTION).",
  "Transport: the credible set is EMPTY; the only registered transport assumptions within the physical prior (a <= 1/16) are the nine ScaledGaussianBohm screening candidates sgb-screen-01..09 (all a = 1/16, profile in channel-length units), identified on P5 xenon (applicability: xenon, P5-like channel, 230-274 V, 5 mg/s). Every H-1 case extrapolates them; P5-N2 v1 left all nine INCONCLUSIVE / NOT ELIGIBLE.",
  "Chemistry: Xe uses the pinned HallThruster.jl built-in tables (no project validity manifest). The only Hall air chemistry is N2/N abep-n2n-0.11 (COMPLETE_FOR_P5_N2_VALIDATION, domain T_e 2-30 eV). There is NO Hall O / O2 chemistry, while atomic O is 5.0-86.0 % of the inflow over the required states: an honest AIR Hall envelope is not possible; N2 runs can only be an N2_PROXY diagnostic.",
  "Xe operating point: no registered H-1 Xe flow (xe_accounting_a9_v3 XV2-17 / XV2-18 TBD).",
  "Numerical settings for the H-1 geometry are not registered (transport v2 DRAFT RG-04 open); the only registered settings are those of the P5-N2 campaign (200 cells over 0.1 m, dt 5 ns, 2 ms, averaging from 1 ms).",
  "Non-Hall inputs of layer (a) are open today: host drag (no ICD), P_bus (official ledger PARTIAL_BOUNDARY, 24 TBD terms, lower bound 0 W), delivered flow (no frozen design point), ICP (NP-ICP-NEUTRALIZER ledger status RUST_IMPL, not admitted), mass (planning DOES_NOT_CLOSE, INCOMPLETE_EVIDENCE, no CBE), thermal and life (NOT_EVALUATED).",
  "Execution environment: this container's network policy denies julialang-s3.julialang.org and pkg.julialang.org (403); HallThruster.jl cannot be installed here (A9.32 recorder note)."
 ],
